  "description": "Antigua and Barbuda Medical Benefits Scheme (MBS) contributions for 2026. Covers the published rate categories (3.5% employee and 3.5% employer from 16 to under 60, 2.5% and 0% from 60 to under 70, nothing from 70, employer only 7% for wages under EC$400 a month or EC$100 a week), the self-employed rates of 5% and 2.5%, the R3A submission and the payment channels, kept apart from social security. Trigger phrases include Antigua medical benefits, MBS contributions, R3A, Antigua payroll medical benefits.",
